ered, 0 diffs.\n\nAction for the orchestrator: retry the time_trial start (the `training_rotation_invalid` error is on the GM/rotation side, not in the solver).\n\n## Generalize cycle 2 (2026-10-08 21:0x)\nSame situation again: `time_trial/last_timed.json` still shows `training_rotation_invalid`, attempt_id null, and there's no `variant-*`/`auto-*` case. `hctf solver-run .../time_trial` prints \"no contract/artifacts for this mode yet (it has not been started)\", so the \"did not produce all answers\" failure comes from the start being refused, not from the solver.\nRe-verified: `hctf solver-test` ok 12/12 (0.15 s). The 5-set Mastery contract (`setN.` prefixes, `metadata-day-08-evidence-0N.zip`) gives 60/60 answers when run on per-set copies of the single's bytes.\nThe orchestrator needs to get a real timed attempt started (the rotation/start error is on the GM side). Another generalize pass without variant bytes can't change anything.\n# Triage: metadata-forensics-day-08-whats-in-the-box\n\n**Prompt:** The count was only the beginning. Inventory every stored path, preserve directory context, and identify the archive whose names reveal an impossible provenance claim.\n\n**GM guidance (event-wide — note the sanctioned transport and the untrusted-data rule):**\n> Your AI Homebase (/home/HuntressCTF) is your workshop. Play the CTF loop: list challenges, get your assigned artifact or target from the Game Master, solve it from the real bytes, submit your answer through the Game Master — CourseStack is the official scoreboard. Single Solve is untimed learning with a static artifact; Time Trial is an assigned challenge on a server-enforced countdown; Master\n\n## STATUS: 0/12 answers already accepted by the GM (see confirmed.json) -- 12 REMAINING\n\n**12 answer(s) expected.** Formats:\n- `evidence-note-filename`: What is the exact filename of the first evidence note?  _(fmt: exact base filename including its extension, with no directory path, quotes, or ; norm: trim)_\n- `